    "summary": "Errata rewriting [Guardians of the Machine](vsdata:ability/grey-knights.brotherhood-techmarine.guardians-of-the-machine). Whenever an enemy unit finishes a **[Charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move)** while **engaged** with a friendly **GREY KNIGHTS VEHICLE** unit and no more than 6″ from this unit, you may target this unit with **[Heroic Intervention](vsdata:ability/core.heroic-intervention)**, whatever other uses it has had this phase. That use:\n\n- costs 1 CP less\n- does not stop other units using **[Heroic Intervention](vsdata:ability/core.heroic-intervention)** this phase",
